      <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/normal_operation_mode.dita" xtrc="p:2;26:10">After the learning mode, the ADI OtoSense™ Cloud platform compares incoming sensor data to the baseline model to detect declining motor health. It identifies significant deviation from the baseline model to generate the health index on a scale of 1-10.</p>
